<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 3.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 3.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement:</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 March 3		 Feb 28</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.503		  5.258</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  14.294		  9.965</p>
<p>Cash balance		  18.797		 15.222</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,272.396	     5,263.191</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $6.0 million were issued and $109 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
